|chunk:1","quote":"记录必须按照当前的 GCP 指导原则保留。所有必要的研究文件包括受试者的记 录、原始文件、CRF 和研究药物库存清单必须记录在案。","quote_sha256":"f7aafa4178dd21690460dacca369e7f10ae2fcf13e0a791098b68b6758b2984d","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:d84680fc442c0c","span_id":"es_data_retention"}],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":["es_confidentiality","es_project_design","es_data_retention"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":2,"project_fact_spans":1},"gap_items":[{"action":"获取本项目监查计划或向医学经理确认监查实施参数","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_12_monitoring_plan","missing_source_classes":["项目监查计划"],"target":"本章节总体框架中监查频率、监查报告审阅流程及远程监查比例"},{"action":"获取项目文件管理SOP或确认适用法规保存期限","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_12_file_retention","missing_source_classes":["研究文件管理SOP"],"target":"本章节中研究文件保存年限、归档地点及销毁程序"}],"heading":"研究文件、监查和管理","missing_source_classes":["项目监查计划（Monitoring Plan）","项目稽查计划（Audit Plan）","研究文件管理SOP","电子数据采集与保存规范"],"proposal_text":"本章节涵盖R2A-PMO-301研究在文件管理、监查实施和稽查核查方面的总体框架。申办者承担确保本研究按照中国药物临床试验质量管理规范、药品注册相关法规及本方案要求开展的道德、法律和科学义务。研究期间产生的所有必要文件，包括受试者医疗记录、原始检查报告、病例报告表、研究药物库存清单及伦理委员会批件，均须按照现行质量管理规范的要求完整记录并妥善保存。本方案所含全部信息归申办方所有，仅供研究者、合作研究者、伦理委员会和药品监督管理部门审阅；未经申办方书面批准，除向受试者解释知情同意内容外，不得向与本研究无关的第三方披露任何方案信息。本章节下设研究方案的依从、监查、稽查和核查三个子节，分别规定方案执行监督、申办者监查活动及独立稽查与监管核查的配合要求。","rationale":"本段依据公司语料中研究数据记录条款（GCP文件保留要求）和方案保密条款（信息归属与分发限制）的监管共性结构撰写，并结合项目研究定义中事件驱动确证性III期设计确认本章节需覆盖文件管理与监查管理的总体框架。具体监查频率、文件保存年限、电子数据管理规则等项目级实施参数缺少对应项目文件，需医学经理补充确认。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_5770a077009c_fc84bbf70b92ab50","section_number":"12","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:0a87d9e9266052d8f6a282ba","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_b4be7d43168c8c1c861f:r9:ec699b5be8be783c","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:d4bef81ce83416","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:544d5795fdc791","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:d84680fc442c0c","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:ea3e32851b5d74","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:342cfc57d67b67"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20261005032107_72665eb1","content_status":"partial","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"section:研究者签字页|block:32|chunk:1","quote":"我将根据中国GCP规定中的程序，按本方案的要求记录临床研究资料，并保证真实、准确、及时、合法地将该临床研究的资料载入病例报告表。我同意接受申办者派遣临床监查员或稽查员对本次临床研究的监查或稽查及药品管理部门的视查，确保临床研究质量。","quote_sha256":"9d5bb308153441df0cf0a282e48e71b5918f97f81ec06babdf8e969557541291","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:544d5795fdc791","span_id":"es_researcher_compliance"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_b4be7d43168c8c1c861f:revision:9","quote":"总体研究设计：随机、双盲、双模拟、安慰剂对照、平行组、事件驱动确证性III期；12个月双盲期后开放序贯地舒单抗12个月","quote_sha256":"4dc441b88f33b8b72ee9fdfdb02df24f1ddf1d04eb6b3c572f5b8469f7f70f79","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_b4be7d43168c8c1c861f:r9:ec699b5be8be783c","span_id":"es_project_design"}],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":["es_researcher_compliance","es_project_design"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":1,"project_fact_spans":1},"gap_items":[{"action":"获取项目方案偏离管理SOP或向医学经理确认报告要求","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_121_deviation_reporting","missing_source_classes":["方案偏离管理SOP"],"target":"方案偏离与方案违背的报告时限、报告路径及分级标准"},{"action":"确认项目方案修订管理程序","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_121_amendment_process","missing_source_classes":["方案修订管理SOP"],"target":"方案修订的伦理审批流程、执行前等待期及通知范围"}],"heading":"研究方案的依从","missing_source_classes":["方案偏离/违背报告SOP","方案修订审批流程文件","研究者培训记录模板"],"proposal_text":"研究者及其授权团队须严格按照本方案规定的研究程序、访视安排、给药方案和评估时点执行研究，不得自行偏离方案要求。研究资料的记录须遵循中国药物临床试验质量管理规范规定的程序，保证真实、准确、及时、合法地将临床研究资料载入病例报告表。研究者须向申办者派遣的临床监查员或稽查员提供访问所有原始资料和研究文件的权限，以支持方案依从性核查。对于方案偏离或方案违背事件，研究者须在发现后及时记录、报告并配合申办者完成根本原因分析和纠正预防措施。本方案经伦理委员会批准后方可实施；方案修订须经伦理委员会重新审批，修订内容在获得批准前不得执行。","rationale":"本段依据公司语料中研究者签字页条款（GCP记录程序、CRF载入承诺、接受监查稽查视查）的监管共性结构撰写。项目研究定义确认本方案为事件驱动确证性III期、双盲双模拟设计，方案依从性对盲态维持和事件判定具有关键意义。方案偏离报告时限、方案修订审批流程细节及方案依从性培训要求缺少项目级文件支持，需医学经理确认。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_5770a077009c_67c154935912bdc0","section_number":"12.1","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:0a87d9e9266052d8f6a282ba","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_b4be7d43168c8c1c861f:r9:ec699b5be8be783c","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:d4bef81ce83416","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:544d5795fdc791","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:d84680fc442c0c","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:ea3e32851b5d74","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:342cfc57d67b67"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20261005032107_72665eb1","content_status":"partial","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"section:9.1 研究监查|block:1175|chunk:1","quote":"申办者有道德上、法律上和科学上的义务，确保研究按照已确立的研究准则、GCP 指导原则、适用的管理要求和法规进行。","quote_sha256":"c6f02e1fb1f9f3b055d9bc75de89c8b8aba248a2eb41a39ca0610ee35439d8ae","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:d4bef81ce83416","span_id":"es_monitoring_obligation"},{"locator":"section:9.1 研究监查|block:1175|chunk:1","quote":"研究者必须向监查员提供访问所有原始资料和研究文件的权限。","quote_sha256":"c856159e9b49c85f9ca42d99d4de03f368bb832ebcfcad96491951d384a78e93","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:d4bef81ce83416","span_id":"es_monitor_visit_access"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_b4be7d43168c8c1c861f:revision:9","quote":"总体研究设计：随机、双盲、双模拟、安慰剂对照、平行组、事件驱动确证性III期；12个月双盲期后开放序贯地舒单抗12个月","quote_sha256":"4dc441b88f33b8b72ee9fdfdb02df24f1ddf1d04eb6b3c572f5b8469f7f70f79","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_b4be7d43168c8c1c861f:r9:ec699b5be8be783c","span_id":"es_project_design"}],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":["es_monitoring_obligation","es_monitor_visit_access","es_project_design"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":2,"project_fact_spans":1},"gap_items":[{"action":"获取项目监查计划或向医学经理确认监查频率安排","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_122_monitoring_frequency","missing_source_classes":["项目监查计划"],"target":"现场监查频率、远程监查比例及首次监查启动时间"},{"action":"获取监查报告模板或确认报告管理要求","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_122_monitoring_report","missing_source_classes":["监查报告模板"],"target":"监查报告模板、提交时限及申办者审阅流程"},{"action":"确认监查员资质标准或获取培训文件","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_122_monitor_qualification","missing_source_classes":["监查员资质与培训文件"],"target":"监查员资质要求、培训内容及授权范围"}],"heading":"监查","missing_source_classes":["项目监查计划（Monitoring Plan）","监查报告模板","监查员资质与培训文件","远程监查操作规范"],"proposal_text":"申办者通过其委派的临床监查员或授权代表对本研究实施监查，以确认研究按照本方案、中国药物临床试验质量管理规范及适用法规执行。监查活动包括定期和不定期的现场访视以及电话和书面沟通，评价内容涵盖受试者安全与福利保障、隐私保护、方案依从性、病例报告表录入的完整性和准确性、病例报告表数据与原始文件的核对以及不良事件的发生与报告情况。研究者须向监查员提供访问所有原始资料和研究文件的权限。监查员在每次现场访视后须向申办者提交监查报告，记录发现的问题、纠正措施及后续跟踪要求。本研究的监查频率、监查报告模板、远程监查与现场监查的比例安排以及监查员资质要求，由申办者依据研究风险等级和监管要求另行制定。","rationale":"本段依据公司语料中研究监查条款（申办者义务、监查员沟通与现场访视、CRF验证、AE监测、原始资料访问权限）的监管共性结构撰写。项目研究定义确认本方案为多中心、事件驱动设计，国内约60家中心参与，监查覆盖范围较广。具体监查频率、报告格式、远程监查比例及监查员资质等项目级实施参数缺少对应项目文件，需医学经理确认。","review_advisories":["本节引用公司语料形成共性表述；定稿时请用本项目权威文件复核适用性。"],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_5770a077009c_333fd7e54192c143","section_number":"12.2","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:0a87d9e9266052d8f6a282ba","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_b4be7d43168c8c1c861f:r9:ec699b5be8be783c","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:d4bef81ce83416","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:544d5795fdc791","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:d84680fc442c0c","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:ea3e32851b5d74","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:342cfc57d67b67"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20261005032107_72665eb1","content_status":"partial","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"section:研究者签字页|block:32|chunk:1","quote":"我将根据中国GCP规定中的程序，按本方案的要求记录临床研究资料，并保证真实、准确、及时、合法地将该临床研究的资料载入病例报告表。我同意接受申办者派遣临床监查员或稽查员对本次临床研究的监查或稽查及药品管理部门的视查，确保临床研究质量。","quote_sha256":"9d5bb308153441df0cf0a282e48e71b5918f97f81ec06babdf8e969557541291","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:544d5795fdc791","span_id":"es_researcher_compliance"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_b4be7d43168c8c1c861f:revision:9","quote":"总体研究设计：随机、双盲、双模拟、安慰剂对照、平行组、事件驱动确证性III期；12个月双盲期后开放序贯地舒单抗12个月","quote_sha256":"4dc441b88f33b8b72ee9fdfdb02df24f1ddf1d04eb6b3c572f5b8469f7f70f79","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_b4be7d43168c8c1c861f:r9:ec699b5be8be783c","span_id":"es_project_design"},{"locator":"section:11.4 研究数据记录|block:1218|chunk:1","quote":"记录必须按照当前的 GCP 指导原则保留。所有必要的研究文件包括受试者的记 录、原始文件、CRF 和研究药物库存清单必须记录在案。","quote_sha256":"f7aafa4178dd21690460dacca369e7f10ae2fcf13e0a791098b68b6758b2984d","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:d84680fc442c0c","span_id":"es_data_retention"}],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":["es_researcher_compliance","es_project_design","es_data_retention"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":2,"project_fact_spans":1},"gap_items":[{"action":"获取项目稽查计划或向医学经理确认稽查安排","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_123_audit_frequency","missing_source_classes":["项目稽查计划"],"target":"稽查频率、稽查范围及稽查员独立性保障机制"},{"action":"获取核查准备SOP或确认核查配合要求","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_123_inspection_prep","missing_source_classes":["核查准备与配合SOP"],"target":"核查前准备程序、文件准备清单及核查配合流程"}],"heading":"稽查和核查","missing_source_classes":["项目稽查计划（Audit Plan）","核查准备与配合SOP","稽查员独立性声明模板"],"proposal_text":"申办者保留对本研究开展独立质量稽查的权利。稽查由独立于研究团队的稽查人员执行，旨在评估研究执行质量、数据完整性和法规依从性。研究者须同意接受申办者派遣的稽查员对本次临床研究的稽查，以及药品监督管理部门的核查和视查，并配合提供所需的全部研究文件、原始资料和受试者记录。稽查和核查前，研究者应确保研究文件处于可查阅状态；稽查和核查期间，研究者及授权人员应如实回答询问并提供必要的解释。稽查发现的问题及核查中提出的整改要求，研究者须在规定时限内完成整改并书面反馈。本研究的稽查频率、稽查范围、稽查员独立性保障机制、核查前准备程序及核查配合流程，由申办者依据研究风险等级和监管要求另行制定。","rationale":"本段依据公司语料中研究者签字页条款（接受稽查员稽查及药品管理部门视查）和研究数据记录条款（文件保留与可查阅要求）的监管共性结构撰写。项目研究定义确认本方案为事件驱动确证性III期、国内多中心研究，稽查与核查配合对数据可信度和注册申报具有关键意义。具体稽查频率、稽查范围、核查准备程序等项目级实施参数缺少对应项目文件，需医学经理确认。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_5770a077009c_9a20efdc27ea7a23","section_number":"12.3","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:0a87d9e9266052d8f6a282ba","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_b4be7d43168c8c1c861f:r9:ec699b5be8be783c","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:d4bef81ce83416","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:544d5795fdc791","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:d84680fc442c0c","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:ea3e32851b5d74","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:342cfc57d67b67"]}],"source_bindings":[{"content_sha256":"99b26370da507299d3bf854285daf6b75b33a646e16410be94dfbf2287fdb37e","locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_5770a077009c_18fe1eae94fe0c67:full-draft:0a87d9e9266052d8f6a282ba","role":"current_working_draft_packet","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:0a87d9e9266052d8f6a282ba","source_type":"protocol_full_draft_selection","source_version":"full-draft:f76e34e427c2bf7e9b3e07e700402957ffd416b32bc3e9419860340778492bfd:0a87d9e9266052d8f6a282ba","text_sha256":"99b26370da507299d3bf854285daf6b75b33a646e16410be94dfbf2287fdb37e"},{"content_sha256":"f3a67b638aca3f31ae0829c6fa150ad367ae59178944e5cf4b5983f0b9d837cf","locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_b4be7d43168c8c1c861f:revision:9","role":"confirmed_project_facts","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_b4be7d43168c8c1c861f:r9:ec699b5be8be783c","source_type":"current_project_study_definition","source_version":"mwdefinition_b4be7d43168c8c1c861f:r9:ec699b5be8be783c","text_sha256":"f3a67b638aca3f31ae0829c6fa150ad367ae59178944e5cf4b5983f0b9d837cf"},{"content_sha256":"308a36177f06e789510202b2b938b2a9e5084c7e222d80919f28732387e33a3e","locator":"section:9.1 研究监查|block:1175|chunk:1","role":"company_sop_or_protocol_reference","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:d4bef81ce83416","source_type":"company_protocol_reference_corpus","source_version":"d4bef81ce83416","text_sha256":"308a36177f06e789510202b2b938b2a9e5084c7e222d80919f28732387e33a3e"},{"content_sha256":"9d5bb308153441df0cf0a282e48e71b5918f97f81ec06babdf8e969557541291","locator":"section:研究者签字页|block:32|chunk:1","role":"company_sop_or_protocol_reference","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:544d5795fdc791","source_type":"company_protocol_reference_corpus","source_version":"544d5795fdc791","text_sha256":"9d5bb308153441df0cf0a282e48e71b5918f97f81ec06babdf8e969557541291"},{"content_sha256":"f7aafa4178dd21690460dacca369e7f10ae2fcf13e0a791098b68b6758b2984d","locator":"section:11.4 研究数据记录|block:1218|chunk:1","role":"company_sop_or_protocol_reference","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:d84680fc442c0c","source_type":"company_protocol_reference_corpus","source_version":"d84680fc442c0c","text_sha256":"f7aafa4178dd21690460dacca369e7f10ae2fcf13e0a791098b68b6758b2984d"},{"content_sha256":"7d0681030b6ed0dc227219e807bad2ae7790f07219b865769ab66b53737549ab","locator":"section:13.4 研究数据记录|block:930|chunk:1","role":"company_sop_or_protocol_reference","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:ea3e32851b5d74","source_type":"company_protocol_reference_corpus","source_version":"ea3e32851b5d74","text_sha256":"7d0681030b6ed0dc227219e807bad2ae7790f07219b865769ab66b53737549ab"},{"content_sha256":"dfc9fceb41db9d941df0e3715483adaa069da4f1953600a6a37a56d7f81373dd","locator":"section:文档开头|block:4|chunk:1","role":"company_sop_or_protocol_reference","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:342cfc57d67b67","source_type":"company_protocol_reference_corpus","source_version":"342cfc57d67b67","text_sha256":"dfc9fceb41db9d941df0e3715483adaa069da4f1953600a6a37a56d7f81373dd"}]}